063964844], "pos": [8242.3544921875, 2301.186767578125], "id": 347, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 19}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": ["第一步：视觉解码与品牌分析\n1. 产品类目(Product_Category): 高端家用电热火锅/多功能电煮锅，厨房小家电，家庭社交餐聚类\n2. 视觉描述(Visual_Description): 圆形电热火锅，整体为深石墨黑配色；上部锅体为微磨砂哑黑涂层，内胆为深色不粘涂层；锅内设有太极形分隔，一半为红油麻辣汤，一半为乳白清汤。外部底座为高光黑塑与拉丝金属控制面板的组合，面板上有温度刻度与指示灯；两侧为宽厚的人体工学手柄，略带弧度与高光反射；结构层次清晰，金属面板和手柄有镜面高光，锅沿为柔和漫反射。食材丰富：红侧有干辣椒、辣油、豆腐块、炸脆块、午餐肉片等；白侧有香菇、枸杞、葱段、菌菇与肉片。整体设计简洁现代，黑色主体与金属细节营造稳重高级感。\n3. 品牌调性(Brand_Vibe): 日系精致与专业感并存的高端家电；现代极简、可靠耐用、围桌而坐的温暖社交氛围；克制而不失丰盛的美味视觉张力\n4. 理想场景(Ideal_Environment): 暗调背景下的温润木质餐桌，周围摆放极简陶瓷蘸料碟、筷子与佐料小盘；微微蒸汽升腾，强调围炉而坐的居家夜晚；背景保持高级留白与层次\n5. 光影风格(Lighting_Style): 影棚控光的高对比度电影光；45°暖色主光勾勒锅体与食材质感，背后冷色轮廓光与顶部轻微填光强调蒸汽与金属高光；浅景深与干净黑背景，突出主体\n\n第二步：变量标准化(Variable Definition)\n{THE_PRODUCT}: A premium Japanese electric hot pot, round matte-black nonstick vessel with a yin-yang divider, glossy black base and a brushed metal control band with temperature markings and indicator lights; wide ergonomic high-gloss handles; subtle bevelled rim with soft matte reflections. Inside: one half is a fire-red spicy broth with dried chilies, chili oil, tofu cubes, crispy fried puffs, and luncheon meat slices; the other half is a creamy milky broth with shiitake mushrooms, goji berries, spring onions, assorted mushrooms, and tender meat slices. Clean, minimal, high-end industrial design with precise fit-and-finish.\n{THE_SCENE}: Set on a rich walnut dining table in a minimalist contemporary home with Japanese accents; dark, refined backdrop; ceramic dipping bowls, lacquered chopsticks, small plates of aromatics and condiments arranged with restraint; gentle steam rising; ample negative space to frame the product.\n{THE_VIBE}: Luxurious, modern, convivial home dining; precise, professional product photography; high-contrast cinematic studio lighting with a warm 45° key, cool back rim to sculpt steam, subtle top fill; crisp specular highlights on metal, soft matte reflections on the rim; shallow depth of field, black-on-black palette with vivid pops of red and ivory from the broths.\n\n第三步：KV级大片提示词（纯英文）\nHero shot of a premium Japanese electric hot pot on a rich walnut table, matte-black nonstick round vessel with a yin-yang divider, glossy black base and brushed metal control band, wide high-gloss ergonomic handles, precise fit-and-finish. Inside, two contrasting broths: a fire-red spicy chili side with dried chilies, chili oil, tofu cubes and crispy fried puffs; and a creamy ivory herbal side with shiitake mushrooms, goji berries, spring onions and tender slices of meat. Minimalist Japanese-inspired dining setup with ceramic dipping bowls, lacquered chopsticks and restrained condiments; dark refined backdrop with ample negative space. High-contrast cinematic studio lighting: warm 45° key light, cool back rim to sculpt steam, subtle top fill; crisp specular highlights on metal, soft matte reflections on the rim. Shallow depth of field, macro product focus, volumetric steam, ultra-detailed textures, rich black-on-black palette with vivid pops of red and ivory. Shot at 85mm, f/2.8, ISO 100, ultra-clean post, 8K resolution, professional food styling, elegant composition centered and slightly above eye level, inviting, luxurious, modern, convivial."], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 479, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [296.25213623046875, 804.2510986328125], "pos": [7588.5732421875, 2463.114501953125], "id": 335, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "links": [494], "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "widgets_values": [1280, 2048, 1],